GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "B408B4D424E87AE3"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{09A4EA215E8CCCBD}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "I. Situation:"
     m_sContent "<h2>I. Situation:</h2>"\
     "<b>Time & Weather:</b>"\
     "Time - 2100 | (It's very bright, also dependent on weather)"\
     "Weather - Defenders Choose"\
     ""\
     "<b>Situation:</b>"\
     "Soviet BMP Company (-) is conducting an incursion onto a Canadian Platoon (-) who have been camping and maintaining security for their Battalion's left flank, with the intended goal to secure the bridge and campsite located further in."
    }
    GC_Briefing "{4F34811158C7EE25}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "A. Enemy Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>A. Enemy Forces:</h2>"\
     "<b>Equipment:</b>"\
     "USSR are equipped with their standard WARSAW Pact weaponry, AK series, RPG7s, RPKs."\
     "Wearing the standard USSR uniform of Tan Camo with greenish helmet."\
     ""\
     "<b>Known Strength:</b>"\
     "1x  BMP-1 Company (-)"\
     ""\
     "<b>Location: </b>"\
     "Located East of our position (Marked on map)"\
     ""\
     "<b>Capabilities:</b>"\
     "Access to RPKs, RPGs."\
     "Vehicles include BMP-1s"\
     ""\
     "<b>MLCOA:</b>"\
     "Push up toward the bridge, dismount 300m from it before conducting the assault"\
     ""\
     "<b>MDCOA:</b>"\
     "Push up toward the bridge, dismount 300m from it before commencing a BMP Bombardment before conducting their assault"\
     ""\
     "<b>Defensive Fires:</b>"\
     "No known threat at this time."\
     ""\
     "<b>Airthreat:</b>"\
     "None."\
     ""\
     "<b>Morale:</b>"\
     "VERY High."\
     ""\
     "<b>CBRN Threat:</b>"\
     "The enemy pose no CBRN Threat."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{EDCFA974D5F558B9}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "A. Enemy Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>A. Enemy Forces:</h2>"\
     "<b>Equipment:</b>"\
     "CAF are equipped with their standard NATO weaponry, M16A1s series, LAWs/M67s, M249s, M60, etc.."\
     "Wearing woodland coloured camo uniforms & helmets."\
     ""\
     "<b>Known Strength:</b>"\
     "1x Rifle Platoon (-)"\
     ""\
     "<b>Location:</b>"\
     "West of our position in a rough spread out fashion (marked on map)"\
     ""\
     "<b>Capabilities:</b>"\
     "Heavy AT."\
     ""\
     "<b>MLCOA:</b>"\
     "Prepare killzones with their AT to destroy as many of our BMPs before pulling back"\
     ""\
     "<b>MDCOA:</b>"\
     "Prepare killzones with their AT and infantry with MGs, to destroy as many of our BMPs before pulling back to fallback positions."\
     ""\
     "<b>Defensive Fires:</b>"\
     "No known threat at this time."\
     ""\
     "<b>Airthreat:</b>"\
     "None."\
     ""\
     "<b>Morale:</b>"\
     "High."\
     ""\
     "<b>CBRN Threat:</b>"\
     "The enemy pose no CBRN Threat."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{5B4C75A915FA7AB3}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "B. Friendly Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>B. Friendly Forces</h2>"\
     "<b>a. Disposition:</b>"\
     "Our Battalion is located to the S-W, we're spread out fairly wide to be able to locate any potential hostile movement while also maintaining security."\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Higher Units Mission:</b>"\
     "Battalion has been tasked with locating any potential soviet build up before consolidating into a defensive line."\
     ""\
     "A few hours prior we engaged and killed 2x BRDMs & 1x BMP-1 who were likely conducting recon, thankfully nothing major and were easy to deal with as lured them in close before engaging."\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Composition:</b>"\
     "1x Platoon (-)"\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Strength:</b>"\
     "1st Platoon - At 26 Man Strength"\
     ""\
     "<b>e. Supporting Fires:</b>"\
     "None."\
     ""\
     "<b>f. Attachments/Detachments:</b>"\
     "None."\
     ""\
     "<b>g. Additional Ammunition</b>"\
     "None."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{90211D4358BF1229}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "B. Friendly Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>B. Friendly Forces</h2>"\
     "<b>a. Disposition:</b>"\
     "East of the objective as marked on map."\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Higher Units Mission:</b>"\
     "Company has been tasked with conducting an incursion on a known Canadian Platoon, whose likely acting as flank security for their battalion / company."\
     ""\
     "A Recon element consisting of 2x BRDMs and 1x BMP-1 has been sent forward earlier to get a better information regarding the battalion, although we've lost all contact with them for the last few hours."\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Composition:</b>"\
     "1x BMP Company (-)"\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Strength:</b>"\
     "340 - At 3x Man Strength."\
     "341 - At 27x Man Strength."\
     "344 - At 27x Man Strength."\
     ""\
     "<b>e. Supporting Fires:</b>"\
     "None."\
     ""\
     "<b>f. Attachments/Detachments:</b>"\
     "None."\
     ""\
     "<b>g. Additional Ammunition</b>"\
     "None."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0BC61B473D639C85}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "II. Mission (Must Read):"
     m_sContent "<h2>II: Mission</h2>"\
     "Prevent the loss of our forward positions that is the Bridge at 060 069 & Campsite at 055 068 as marked on map."\
     ""\
     "We have 1000x Sandbags + 10x Backpacks in a crate near us to be able to set up our forward positions."\
     ""\
     "Be wary of the BMP-1's HEFRAG rounds"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{5ED073DB36DF7344}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "II. Mission (Must Read):"
     m_sContent "<h2>II: Mission</h2>"\
     "Secure the Bridge at 060 069 and their Campsite at 055 068 as marked on map, to threaten their Battalion, hopefully forcing them to fall back."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{D421202CACC290C4}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "III. Execution:"
     m_sContent "<h2>III: Execution</h2>"\
     "<b>Intent:</b>"\
     "Protect our Battalion Flank and ensuring we do not lose our positions."\
     ""\
     "<b>1. Concept of the Operation:</b>"\
     "Platoon Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised to utilize our sandbags to setup forward and fallback positions."\
     ""\
     "<b>2. Maneuver</b>"\
     "Platoon Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised to not split up the squads too much or too far ahead so they can mutually support one another if needed."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{77EC765A64F417E6}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "III. Execution:"
     m_sContent "<h2>III: Execution</h2>"\
     "<b>Intent:</b>"\
     "Push hard and aggressive"\
     ""\
     "<b>1. Concept of the Operation:</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised to move up and DISMOUNT 300M from the treeline, before conducting the assault with the BMP's firepower and either A) Infantry using the BMP for cover or B) Infantry screening the BMP and engaging the treeline as well."\
     ""\
     "<b>2. Maneuver</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised to NOT split up the Platoons to assault separately. It is highly advised to keep the company together so they can mutually support one another and show the Canadians true firepower."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{70150666F6BB4E08}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "IV. Sustainment:"
     m_sContent "<h2>IV: Sustainment</h2>"\
     "<b>a. SOP Variations</b>"\
     "Dress: Standard Canadian Uniform"\
     "Equipment: Standard Canadian Loadout"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Logistical Support:</b>"\
     "Replen Plan: None for 24h."\
     "Ammunition: Each man carries his own ammunition."\
     "IPE: Helmets and body armour are to be worn at all times."\
     ""\
     "Crate outside contains:"\
     "- 1000x Sandbags"\
     "- 10x Backpacks"\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Medical:</b>"\
     "Location: Company Aid Post is to be setup by platoon medic."\
     "CASEVAC: By foot or with Platoon Assets like HMMWVs if there are any."\
     "Plan: Set up a casualty collection point and extract casualties to this point."\
     "Stretchers: None"\
     "Med Packs: Platoon medpack carried by platoon medic."\
     "Morphine: Every soldier carries 1+ stick of morphine."\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Vehicles:</b>"\
     "None."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{EE072059688A53EB}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "IV. Sustainment:"
     m_sContent "<h2>IV: Sustainment</h2>"\
     "<b>a. SOP Variations</b>"\
     "Dress: Standard Soviet Uniform"\
     "Equipment: Standard Soviet Loadout"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Logistical Support:</b>"\
     "Replen Plan: None for 24h."\
     "Ammunition: Each man carries his own ammunition."\
     "IPE: Helmets and body armour are to be worn at all times."\
     ""\
     "Each BMP Carries"\
     "- 8x Bandages"\
     "- 4x tourniquets"\
     "- 4x Morphine"\
     "- 4x Grenades"\
     "- 10x Smoke Grenades"\
     "- 50x 30rnd AK Mags"\
     "- 12x 45rnd RPK Mags"\
     "- 5x VOGs"\
     "- 50x Flares Green"\
     "- 50x Flares Orange"\
     "- 50x Flares White"\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Medical:</b>"\
     "Location: Company Aid Post is to be setup by platoon medic."\
     "CASEVAC: By foot or with company asset like BMP-1s"\
     "Plan: Set up a casualty collection point and extract casualties to this point."\
     "Stretchers: None"\
     "Med Packs: Platoon medpack carried by platoon medic."\
     "Morphine: Every soldier carries 1+ stick of morphine."\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Vehicles:</b>"\
     "7x BMP-1s"\
     "Each BMP can carry 8x Troops + 3x Crew"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{FA4A454AA803ABF8}" {
     m_iOrder 11
     m_sTitle "V. Command & Signals:"
     m_sContent "<b>I. Chain of Command:</b>"\
     "21, 21 Alpha, 21 Bravo"\
     ""\
     "<b>II. Callsigns:</b>"\
     "Platoon HQ ------------------ 21"\
     "1st Section ------------------- 21A - Alpha"\
     "2nd Section ------------------ 21B - Bravo"\
     "3rd Section ------------------- 21C - Charlie"\
     ""\
     "<b>III. Frequencies:</b>"\
     "1st Platoon Net ------------ 48.00 MHz"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{94C726A3B2006EBA}" {
     m_iOrder 12
     m_sTitle "V. Command & Signals:"
     m_sContent "<b>I. Chain of Command:</b>"\
     "340 -> 341 HQ -> 344 HQ -> 347 (HQ) -> 341 -> etc"\
     ""\
     "<b>II. Callsigns:</b>"\
     "Company HQ ------------------------------ 340 (Radio)"\
     ""\
     "1st Platoon HQ --------------------------- 341 (HQ)"\
     "1st Rifle Squad --------------------------- 341"\
     "2nd Rifle Squad -------------------------- 342"\
     "3rd Rifle Squad --------------------------- 343"\
     ""\
     "2nd Platoon HQ -------------------------- 344 (HQ)"\
     "1st Rifle Squad --------------------------- 344"\
     "2nd Rifle Squad -------------------------- 345"\
     "3rd Rifle Squad --------------------------- 346"\
     ""\
     "- - - Vehicle Callsigns when Infantry dismounted:"\
     "340v - Victor"\
     "341v - Victor"\
     "342v - Victor"\
     "Etc."\
     ""\
     "<b>III. Frequencies:</b>"\
     "Company Net ------------------------------ 42.00 MHz"\
     "(YOU'RE ALL IN ONE NET, RADIO DISCIPLINE.)"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{720B41657C3F48D3}" {
     m_iOrder 13
     m_sTitle "VI. Mission Notes:"
     m_sContent "<h2>Mission Notes:</h2>"\
     "<b>Timelimit:</b>"\
     "- 60m (Can be increased by GM's Discretion) "\
     "- 5min Setup Timer."\
     ""\
     "<b>OPFOR Victory:</b>"\
     "by Capturing Both Objectives:"\
     "- Bridge"\
     "- Campsite"\
     "OR"\
     "- 90% Canadian Casualties"\
     ""\
     "<b>BLUFOR Victory:</b>"\
     "- Time Limit"\
     "- 80% OPFOR Casualties"\
     ""\
     "<b>GM Discretion as usual.</b>"
    }
    GC_Briefing "{3934D6C712F698B3}" {
     m_iOrder 14
     m_sTitle "Game Mastering (READ BEFORE LOBBY)"
     m_sContent "<h2>Game Mastering</h2>"\
     "This mission is designed for game mastering from the lobby, but besides that should only be manipulated for technical, administrative or diagnostic purposes."\
     ""\
     "GAMEMASTERS! USE PRECISE TIMES OR I WILL HAUNT THE SHIT OUT OF YOU."\
     ""\
     "<b>ATTACKERS CHOOSES TIME:</b>"\
     "Weather: "\
     "- 0515z | Dawn"\
     "- 1200z | Day"\
     "- 2030z | Dusk"\
     "- 2130z | Very early night, Fairly bright, dependent on weather picked"\
     ""\
     "<b>DEFENDERS CHOOSES WEATHER:</b>"\
